Z||000028||FLASHY||09-27-2001||01:56 AM||||Mike: I tried making your car one color, it's the best I can do. Looks great IMO.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/billfredmike_solid.jpg"> <P>Jaygee79: The color is the factory burgundy believe it or not. My digital camera enhances the color justa bit plus the strong lighting gave it more contrast. It looks slightly deeper and more metalic on the screen I know but it's really not that far off. I've kept the paint in fairly good shape over the years. I wax it 2 or 3 times a year and wash it constantly. It's also barely ever been stored outdoors so it has next to no sun fade or oxidation. I'm happy with it but it would be nicer if it looked exactly like it does in this thread. Thanks for the compliment!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>And thanks to the other compliments as well. Makes me feel good   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR><p>[This message has been edited by FLASHY (edited 09-27-2001).]||||reg||1
