Z||000032||LZeitgeist||09-27-2001||08:58 AM||||The reason I like the two-tone so much better on that car is related directly to the wheels you have on there - the matching color between the ground effects and the wheels really makes it sing, in my book.<P>Don't listen to these other guys - they want your car to be ugly so their's looks better in comparison.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I'm much more secure in my car so I don't mind if yours looks better than mine, so you should listen to me and go with the two-tone.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Good luck with whatever you choose to do - either way, it's a gorgeous car.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ||||reg||1
