Z||000041||Voytek||09-27-2001||04:34 PM||||Allow me to add to that warm, fuzzy feeling you have inside.  NICE CAR!!<P>My vote?  One-tone.  You've summarized it well.  Bottom line: it's 2001.  I haven't seen any 2-tone factory paint for at least 10 years.  The paint needs to match the Fieros modern and exotic curves.  If it was a gen. 1 MR2 I'd say 2-tone, 3-tone or even paint flowers on it.  Once a box, always a box.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/voyteks_sig2.gif"> ||||reg||1
